# data/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The seeded worlds (~2MB of pretty-printed JSON) are committed on purpose. A seeded
# generator is reproducible in principle; a committed artefact is reproducible in
# practice. It means anyone can open the exact population behind every number in the
# README — including data/*.truth.json, the answer key, which is the part they should
# check hardest. It also closes the gap where I tweak the generator, regenerate a
# slightly different world, and never notice the headline figures moved.
